# ToolkitCrypto - PRD

## Features
- Hardware-bound `SecureEnclave` P256 key generation.
- AES-GCM local encrypted key-value vault.
- SHA-256 TLS Certificate Pinning.

## Requirements
- No secrets can be dumped to disk outside of the Keychain wrapper.
- All symmetric encryption must leverage authenticated cryptography (GCM/ChaCha).
